    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18224" root="زند" body-key="z">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَدَ النَّارَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنِدَ</span></b> , <i>He produced fire</i> [<i>with a</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْد</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْدَة</span>]. (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَدُوا نَارَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَرْبِ</span> (assumed tropical:) [<i>They kindled the fire of war</i>]. (A,
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also 2. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنِدَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَدَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَدٌ</span>, (TK,) <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>thirsted.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنِدَتْ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنَدٌ</span>, said of a she-camel, <i>Her womb
came forth on her giving birth.</i> (L.)

